Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the programmer in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be like, I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from. I don't wanna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.34,0:00:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.25,0:00:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.17,0:01:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three Come and find a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is my one and only\Ntrusted assistant, Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.38,0:02:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlotte, dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,if you would please give our prisoners a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,brief rundown of what\Ntheir lives will be like?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,for the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here in this prison facility, we\Nrepresent the ideas of our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,placing emphasis on equality.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish to wander around\Nor partake in exercise,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you are free to do so\Nin a designated area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use the phones, take\Na shower, or read books.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,An exemplary prisoner can\Neven have a TV in their cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Some may be allowed to work and are given\Na chance to study for a college degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard her, and that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, Charlotte, do\Nyou have a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered, there are rules that\Nmust be followed too, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, of course, Charlotte,\Nyou're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,under no circumstances are\Nyou allowed to take off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the wristband with your\Ndesignated prisoner number.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Second, there will be no borrowing\Nor lending things among inmates,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and any metal materials are prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is wearing earring still okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth right this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The chief is speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:03:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they're not allowed,\Ninmate FE40536 Joling Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have any further inquiries, please\Nask the guards and they can assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Orientation is complete! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, turn and face to your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the prison covers\Nthis whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, alligator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,F. E.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.09,0:03:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,40536, welcome to your\Nnew home, cell number 206.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Break time for today is come and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The cell opens at 6.30 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Breakfast begins at 7 a .m., but if\Nyou wish to sleep in, you're allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you two can get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:03:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Gwess. Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But so much stuff happened today\Nthat I just don't have an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're new here, but\Nthe bottom book is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna have a problem with\Nthat, you stupid little whore?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.64,0:04:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jojo! Bee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not interested in fighting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your stuff on the top\Nbed, so I thought it was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're trying to jack my stuff too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to see that closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you open that charm,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll find a small stone and\Na picture of my parents inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be the one I threw away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought this for two bucks\Nfrom a new inmate the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me, you filthy bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:04:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:04:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm letting you see it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll buy it off of you. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Name your price
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,200 bucks. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me dumbass? I said 200
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The heck's up with everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So many strange things happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind is racing with thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so lonely, I could cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,About last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's fine if you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, that pic of your\Nparents wasn't in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't think this\Nis the charm you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Was anything inside at all? Like a stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, there wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, can you forgive\Nmy actions from yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when meeting new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, it was my fault for assuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still learning how things work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Jolene, you're such a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we can become close friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's the buzzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's breakfast time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See you there, bestie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.76,0:06:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.22,0:07:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with all this water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My pants are soaking wet now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but what do you mean\Nthe food's sold out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even had my meal yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see it's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here at GD, you've got\Nthe freedom to sleep in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,just like you have the\Nfreedom to arrive late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you have food\Nprepared for everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to at least have a banana left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call one of\Nthe Seven Wonders of Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jolyne, guess you decided to sleep in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so full, I couldn't eat another bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Glass, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just see two milks and\Ntwo bananas on your tray?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I have two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, sorry about all\Nthe water I spilled on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll clean it all up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I already took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's so nice of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly over here and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you can do it with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do anything\Nwith the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, as long as we trust each\Nother, anything is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so freaking adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you could pull it off for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Coffee chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have a treat, darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we've talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.74,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't greet me with good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's love, you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's much cuter when you\Nsay you love me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good, good, good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:08:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my perfect little man, coffee chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, something harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Try flying to my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To build trust between us, we have to\Ntake risks here and there, Kapi-Chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Whoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do little birdies say,\Nwhoa, where you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, don't you start messing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you got some superficial idea\Nabout what love and trust should be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've broken that trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something just go by?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What is up with this weird bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Small, but it has to be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a tiny person\Ninside, and she killed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Glass. That woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The only explanation for this is\Nshe has that stone from the amulet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and it gave her some\Nkind of special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell is\Nwith that small human?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.55,0:11:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.53,0:11:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My body...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it just shrink?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So the culprit was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you take my\Ncopychan away from me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.78,0:11:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! Jolene! Jolene! Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I'm starting to\Nlike you more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we'd be good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to stop talking, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like that person in the parrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Put this on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I already removed all the guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The parrot had some disadvantages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor thing couldn't\Nhold or carry things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But rats are better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got four paws.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,As for him, he was a guard\Nwho got fired for being lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The chief and everyone\Nthinks he already went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, I know\NI told you not to speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll let it slide if\Nyou do it in a cutesy way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mike, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mommy, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please feed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, so stinking adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's begin your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster, faster, faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.56,0:12:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me some hustle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now lift them up, Chorokichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Chorokichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything has a name, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beginning was the Word,\Nand the Word was with God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Word was God, and\Nthrough Him all was made.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And without Him nothing was\Nmade that had been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:13:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So this mental power that\Nshrank you deserves a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Jojo Dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that will be the\Nname of my mental ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's add another book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Naughty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you being cunning and trying to cheat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, you're not gonna\Nbetray my trust, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not trying to ruin\Nour relationship, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats, Todokichi, you passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to need that\Ncunning wit for your next task.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Very, very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,At the far end of this corridor,\Nyou're going to find a control center.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your objective is to get\Nto that switch over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It can unlock all the cells\Nand doors in this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If we work together, we can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:14:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I can't\Nmake myself smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Though luckily, we have you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's important we trust each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.30,0:14:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the actual\Ncommencement is further ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,For this mission, you just need to\Ninvestigate everything beyond this corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think we\Ncan escape like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go forgetting I told you\Nto speak in a cutesy way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This control center?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How exactly am I supposed\Nto crawl over to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a Code!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my adorable baby rat girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't ask me, you dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Figuring that part out is your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look above you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a surveillance camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be in its blind spot\Nif you go under the handrail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So just go straight below it\Nand keep the rat corpse on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.36,0:14:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, hurry up and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Girl with the headband!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me your name and prison number!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The number's FE18081, and my name is Wes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just taking a walk around\Nthe corridors if you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,have any business here get\Naway from the gate and leave
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There are four steel doors in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder which one of\Nthem leads to the control
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,center and there are cameras\Nin the corner two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What the why is it so tight! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that sound just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man, I heard that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:15:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's getting bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a coffee maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that the sound it\Nmakes when it's ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.61,0:16:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because Quest left?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is distance related to her ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.52,0:16:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely heard it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be in here somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! Shit! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get out of the way! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's freaking hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, YB!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you idiots it was the coffee\Nmaker, but you wouldn't listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this investigation!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to fit through the bars\Nbefore my body grows any bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee. Gee. Dolph.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like a doll,\Nbut it's transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Same as my thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a physical manifestation of\NGwess' energy that no one else can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Jojo dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that will be the\Nname of my mental ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.10,0:17:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This baby doll from hell is what shrunk me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and ripped the guard and\Nthe parrot to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That must mean it was just chilling\Ninside the rat with me the entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm willing to bet that Gwess has no\Nidea her ability weakens if she's far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so she doesn't know my\Nbody's growing back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:17:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've got a murderous\Nmunchkin chasing me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,down because it thinks\Nthat I was running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't get out of here,\Nthe thing's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,G. Damn it. G.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I ever do to\Ndeserve a fate like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how I go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,By this creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,G. G.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,G.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a whole clump of threads.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the form that\Nmy energy takes. A clump.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When they gather and clump,\Nit becomes three-dimensional.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What a concept!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream your heart out, bastard child!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now call Gwess over here and hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I wasn't expecting\Nyou to also have an ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, please,\NJolene, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop strangling my GG doll so tightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on shrinking my body enough\Nso I can squeeze out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but only just a little, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, you can even\Nhave the bottom bunk, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we've been through a\Nlot, but please don't hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, though, I'd like you to speak\Nto me all cutesy from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry and do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hand over the amulet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes the stone inside, and I\Nwant to know who you bought it from, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be $200.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the fuck up, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me the name before I kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I'm not sure, but I\Nthink her name was Hermes. Hermes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.34,0:20:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know her that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.94,0:20:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.86,0:20:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a prisoner past the gunpoint!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.66,0:20:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you, the hell are you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get past the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Prison break! Code 999!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be the end of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you didn't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.09,0:20:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,that guard just went to pick up his\Nshotgun and since you're behind the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,he's got the right to shoot your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No questions asked!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's just what you deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You hurt my feelings, and\Nnow you're gonna die for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good freakin' grief, Quest. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen, you said everything\Nhas a name, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll name my ability, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be Stone Ocean, cause somehow I'm\Ngonna free myself from the Sea of Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean, that's the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.44,0:21:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's some sort of\Nhierarchy in this prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll follow it as much as I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm the one who's gonna\Nbe giving out orders here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.56,0:21:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shrink me down and get me\Nthe hell out of this hallway!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really sure you saw her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but I only\Nsaw her from the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.74,0:22:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.74,0:22:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.74,0:22:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.74,0:22:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,about all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.16,0:23:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the things I'd like to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.56,0:23:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,a distant dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,dreaming far
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,away from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.82,0:23:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.88,0:24:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
